<p>* DUTCH STATE LOANS	 PRICES			  BID YIELDS</p>
<p>  June 1999 7.50 pct	106.16/26 (+0.01)	   3.94 (UNCHD)</p>
<p>  Feb  2002		   113.93/03 (+0.03)	   4.73 (UNCHD)</p>
